You and I both know this wasn't about the money.
/juː ænd aɪ ˈboʊθ ˈnoʊ ðɪs ˈwʌzn̩t ɐˌbaʊt ðə ˈmʌni/

98
00:04:58,485 --> 00:05:01,138
Sure, Metro News One pays you jack,
/ˈʃʊr ˈmɛtroʊ ˈnuːz ˈwʌn ˈpeɪz juː ˈdʒæk/

99
00:05:01,138 --> 00:05:06,177
and, hey, a little green salad on the side is good for you, me, and Mr. McGee.
/ˈænd ˈheɪ ɐ ˈlɪɾəl ˈɡriːn ˈsæləd ɑːnðə ˈsaɪd ɪz ˈɡʊd fɔːr juː ˈmiː ænd ˈmɪstɚ mə ˈdʒiː/

100
