and so for two more hundie sticks,
/ænd ˌsoʊ fɔːr ˈtuː ˈmoːr ˈhʌndi ˈstɪks/

105
00:05:19,447 --> 00:05:23,244
baby's going to look in the camera and say this.
/ˈbeɪbiz ˌɡoʊɪŋ tə ˈlʊk ɪnðə ˈkæmrə ænd ˈseɪ ˈðɪs/

106
