I'm just assuming.
/aɪm ˈdʒʌst ɐˈsuːmɪŋ/

107
00:05:28,256 --> 00:05:30,049
I gotta get back twork.
/aɪ ˈɡɑːɾə ɡɛt ˈbæk ˈtwɜːk/

108
00:05:30,929 --> 00:05:32,572
- See ya.
- Bye.

109
00:05:32,572 --> 00:05:34,609
Baby's gonna think about it.
/ˈbeɪbiz ˌɡənə ˈθɪŋk ɐˈbaʊt ɪt/

110
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:40,028
Found it!
/ˈfaʊnd ɪt/
I found Natalie's number.
/aɪ ˈfaʊnd ˈnæɾɐliz ˈnʌmbɚ/

111
00:05:40,028 --> 00:05:43,988
Hey, Ted! Nice shirt!
/ˈheɪ ˈtɛd ˈnaɪs ˈʃɜːt/
Is it yesterday already?
/ɪz ɪt ˈjɛˌstɚdeɪ ɔˈːlrɛdi/

112
00:05:44,788 --> 00:05:46,964
