126
00:06:30,658 --> 00:06:34,849
Okay, so I didn't want to get a boyfriend-level gift for a girl I was just about to break up with.
/oʊˈkeɪ ˌsoʊ aɪ ˈdɪdnt ˈwɑːnt tə ɡɛt ɐ ˈbɔɪfrɛˈndlɛvəl ˈɡɪft fɚrə ˈɡɜːl aɪ wʌz ˈdʒʌst ɐˌbaʊt tə ˈbreɪk ˈʌp wɪð/

127
00:06:34,849 --> 00:06:37,259
