/ˌsoʊ juː ˈdʌmpt hɜː ˈraɪt bɪˌfoːr hɜː ˈbɜːθdeɪ/

128
00:06:37,259 --> 00:06:41,348
No, I didn't dump her right before her birthday.
/ˈnoʊ aɪ ˈdɪdnt ˈdʌmp hɜː ˈraɪt bɪˌfoːr hɜː ˈbɜːθdeɪ/

129
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:47,046
Natalie! Hey.
/ˈnæɾɐli ˈheɪ/
Happy birthday.
/ˈhæpi ˈbɜːθdeɪ/

130
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:49,317
Listen... :
/ˈlɪsən ˈkoʊlən/

131
00:06:49,317 --> 00:06:53,930
- Never break up with a girl on her birthday!
- Lily, please! The shirt!

132
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:56,126
I know!
/aɪ ˈnoʊ/
It was a mistake!
/ɪt wʌzɐ mɪˈsteɪk/

133
00:06:56,126 --> 00:06:59,654
