- Natalie! Hey, happy birthday.

136
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:10,192
Listen...
/ˈlɪsən/

137
00:07:11,793 --> 00:07:15,557
You're awesome.
/jʊr ˈɔːsʌm/
You really are.
/juː ˈriəli ɑːr/

138
00:07:15,557 --> 00:07:16,878
Awesome.
/ˈɔːsʌm/

139
